~ Akira_first_met
Oh, hey! You're awake!
Are you okay...?

- Who are you?
	Akira: I'm Akira! I take care of parts in the village.
Akira: Um... Elvic and I were talking about the earthquake earlier.
Akira: There was another one, and we heard someone running in the cave...
Akira: Elvic found you. He said you were hit by falling rocks.
Akira: But... you're really lucky. You don't seem badly hurt.
Akira: Still... that doesn't mean you're completely fine, right?
Akira: How are you feeling now?
- I'm okay
	Akira: That's great! I'm so glad to heard that!!
- I can't feel anything
	Akira: Oh no... that sounds a little scary...
	Akira: If you need anything at all, please tell me, okay?
Akira: And... um, please don't go into the cave for now.
Akira: It collapsed pretty badly...
Akira: I still don't know how Elvic carried you out with just one arm...
Akira: I'll stay here with you, just in case you need anything!
=> END

